 * Declares the record Mangler, that mangle the name of a generator to make it
 * uniq, by containing location and type information.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::mangler
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/mangler.yr
 * @Author(s):
